<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA 2ND DAY CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA 2ND DAY CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>WANGARATTA, Australia 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 312 for five in reply to Victoria's first innings of 354 at the close of play on the second day of a four-day match on Friday.</p>
<p>Score - West Indies first innings 312 for five (Brian Lara 86, Sherwin Campbell 80); Victoria first innings 354 (Graeme Vimpani 133, Darren Berry 50; Nixon McLean five for 48).</p>
